x_ID\" class=\"BVRRReviewText\"><div class=\"BVRRReviewTextParagraph BVRRReviewTextFirstParagraph BVRRReviewTextLastParagraph\"> <span class=\"BVRRReviewText\">The blower to the badger power isn\u2019t what I expected. It\u2019s exactly what it says a sweeper!!!!!!!<br />String trimmer seems to be good used half a minute.<\/span>\n<\/div><\/div> <\/div>\n\n\n\n\n\n<\/div>\n\n <div class=\"RRBeforeFeedbackContainerSpacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n<div class=\"BVDI_FV\"><div class=\"BVDI_FVVoting BVDI_FVVotingHelpfulness\"><div class=\"BVDI_FVSum BVDI_FVSumHelpfulness\"><span class=\"BVDI_FVZero BVDI_FVLevel1\"><span class=\"BVDIValue BVDINumber\">0<\/span><span class=\"BVDISuffix\">points<\/span><\/span><\/div><div class=\"BVDI_FVCounts BVDI_FVCountsHelpfulness\"><\/div><div class=\"BVDI_FVVotes BVDI_FVVotesHelpfulness\"><span class=\"BVDIPrefix\">Was this helpful?<\/span><span class=\"BVDI_FVVote BVDI_FVPositive BVDI_FVLevel1\"><a data-bvjsref=\"https://walmart.ugc.bazaarvoice.com/submit/1336/5629858326/review/397090220/positive.djs?authsourcetype=__AUTHTYPE__&amp;format=embeddedhtml&amp;innerreturn=https%3A%2F%2Fwalmart.ugc.bazaarvoice.com%2F1336%2F5629858326%2Freviews.djs%3Fformat%3Dembeddedhtml%26num%3D100%26sort%3DsubmissionTime&amp;return=__RETURN__&amp;sessionparams=__BVSESSIONPARAMS__&amp;submissionparams=__BVSUBMISSIONPARAMETERS__&amp;submissionurl=__BVSUBMISSIONURL__&amp;user=__USERID__\" data-bvcfg=\"__CONFIGKEY__\" name=\"BV_TrackingTag_Review_Display_AddPositiveFeedback_397090220\" href=\"javascript://\" title=\"Yes\" class=\"BVDILink BVDIValue\"><span class=\"BVDILinkSpan\"><span class=\"BVDINumber\">0<\/span><\/span><\/a><\/span><span class=\"BVDI_FVVote BVDI_FVNegative BVDI_FVLevel1\"><a data-bvjsref=\"https://walmart.ugc.bazaarvoice.com/submit/1336/5629858326/review/397090220/negative.djs?authsourcetype=__AUTHTYPE__&amp;format=embeddedhtml&amp;innerreturn=https%3A%2F%2Fwalmart.ugc.bazaarvoice.com%2F1336%2F5629858326%2Freviews.djs%3Fformat%3Dembeddedhtml%26num%3