iner\"><span class=\"BVRRLabel BVRRReviewTitlePrefix\"><\/span><span itemprop=\"name\" class=\"BVRRValue BVRRReviewTitle\">Improve the work efficiency<\/span><span class=\"BVRRLabel BVRRReviewTitleSuffix\">, <\/span><\/div>\n<div class=\"BVRRReviewDateContainer\"><span class=\"BVRRLabel BVRRReviewDatePrefix\"><\/span><span class=\"BVRRValue BVRRReviewDate\">11/05/2024<meta itemprop=\"datePublished\" content=\"2024-11-05\"/><\/span><span class=\"BVRRLabel BVRRReviewDateSuffix\"><\/span><\/div>\n<div class=\"BVRRReviewDisplayStyle3Content\">\n <div itemprop=\"description\" class=\"BVRRReviewTextContainer\" >\n\n\n\n\n<div id=\"BVRRReviewAbbreviatedText362482519_39ksj3iwflo9tpzotudtvdg0n_ID\" class=\"BVRRReviewAbbreviatedText\"><div class=\"BVRRReviewAbbreviatedTextParagraph BVRRReviewAbbreviatedTextFirstParagraph BVRRReviewAbbreviatedTextLastParagraph\"> <span class=\"BVRRReviewAbbreviatedText\">The switch between the mower and the vacuum cleaner is very convenient and quick, and only requires a simple operation to complete the switch. This allows the user to adjust the usage mode at any time according to the actual needs, and improves the<\/span>\n<span class=\"BVRRReviewAbbreviatedTextSuffix\"><span class=\"BVDI_AbbreviatedLinkPrefix\">...<\/span><span class=\"BVDI_AbbreviatedLink\"><a onclick=\" if(window.BVAnalyticsTracker){BVAnalyticsTracker.fireActionEvent(this);};&#10;$bv('#BVRRReviewAbbreviatedText362482519_39ksj3iwflo9tpzotudtvdg0n_ID').toggleClass('BVDIHidden');$bv('#BVRRReview362482519_2tsrif1royx605s2qarkw4t56_ID').toggleClass('BVDIHidden');bvStopPropagation(event);return false;\" name=\"BV_TrackingTag_Review_Display_ToggleReadMore\" href=\"#\" class=\"BVDILink \"><span class=\"BVDILinkSpan\">(read full review)<\/span><\/a><\/span><span class=\"BVDI_AbbreviatedLinkSuffix\"><\/span><\/span><\/div><\/div>\n<div id=\"BVRRReview362482519_2tsrif1royx605s2qarkw4t56_ID\" class=\"BVRRReviewText BVDIHidden\"><div class=\"BVRRReviewTextParagraph BVRRReviewTextFirstParagraph BVRRReviewTextLastParagraph\"> <span class=\"BVRRReviewText\">The switch between the mower and the vacuum cleaner is very convenient and quick, and only requires a simple operation to complete the switch. This allows the user to adjust the usage mode at any time according to the actual needs, and improves the work efficiency.<\/span>\n<span class=\"BVRRReviewTextSuffix\"><span class=\"BVDI_FullLinkPrefix\"><\/span><span class=\"BVDI_FullLink\"><a onclick=\" if(window.BVAnalyticsTracker){BVAnalyticsTracker.fireActionEvent(this);};&#10;$bv('#BVRRReviewAbbreviatedText362482519_39ksj3iwflo9tpzotudtvdg0n_ID').toggleClass('BVDIHidden');$bv('#BVRRReview362482519_2tsrif1royx605s2qarkw4t56_ID').toggleClass('BVDIHidden');bvStopPropagation(event);return false;\" name=\"BV_TrackingTag_Review_Display_ToggleReadMore\" href=\"#\" class=\"BVDILink \"><span class=\"BVDILinkSpan\">(hide full review)<\/span><\/a><\/span><span class=\"BVDI_FullLinkSuffix\"><\/span><\/span><\/div><\/div> <\/div>\n\n\n\n\n\n<\/div>\n\n <div class=\"RRBeforeFeedbackContainerSpacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n<div class=\"BVDI_FV\"><div class=\"BVDI_FVVoting BVDI_FVVotingHelpfulness\"><div class=\"BVDI_FVSum BVDI_FVSumHelpfulness\"><span class=\"BVDI_FVPositive BVDI_FVLevel2\"><span class=\"BVDIPrefix\">+<\/span><span class=\"BVDIValue BVDINumber\">3<\/span><span class=\"BVDISuffix\">points<\/span><\/span><\/div><div class=\"BVDI_FVCounts BVDI_FVCountsHelpfulness\"><\/div><div class=\"BVDI_FVVotes BVDI_FVVotesHelpfulness\"><span class=\"BVDIPrefix\">Was this helpful?<\/span><span class=\"BVDI_FVVote BVDI_FVPositive BVDI_FVLevel2\"><a data-bvjsref=\"https://walmart.ugc.bazaarvoice.com/submit/1336/5629858326/review/362482519/positive.djs?authsourcetype=__AUTHTYPE__&amp;format=embeddedhtml&amp;innerreturn=https%3A%2F%2Fwalmart.ugc.bazaarvoice.com%2F1336%2F5629858326%2Freviews.djs%3Fformat%3Dembeddedhtml%26num%3D100%26sort%3DsubmissionTime&amp;return=__RETURN__&amp;sessionparams=__BVSESSIONPARAMS__&amp;submissionp